_1782271979425_3aynqc6","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"group_1779420032712","_id":13171},{"id":1782277218550,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","senderName":"执行官","text":"再敢用后视镜多偷看一眼，本官就亲手挖了你的光学眼。专心开你的车。","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:34.621Z","roundId":"group_round_1782271979425_3aynqc6","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"group_1779420032712","_id":13173},{"id":1782277218551,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c18ad874-7182-4031-bd5e-223466aaab84","senderName":"卡帕","text":"收到。我的听觉模块正好需要常规维护，现在立刻进入物理断电休眠状态。各位中午好，我暂时是一具行政尸体了。","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:36.325Z","roundId":"group_round_1782271979425_3aynqc6","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"group_1779420032712","_id":13175},{"id":1782277218552,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"f51d37b3-7a4e-4e8a-ba8e-d5bcb338c0e0","senderName":"伽马","text":"记录：检测到极度异常的情绪波动和占有欲。这载具里的温度怕是已经快自燃了吧。","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:39.173Z","roundId":"group_round_1782271979425_3aynqc6","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"group_1779420032712","_id":13177},{"id":1782277218553,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","senderName":"执行官","text":"表情包：不嘻嘻","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:39.691Z","stickerMeaning":"不嘻嘻","roundId":"group_round_1782271979425_3aynqc6","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"group_1779420032712","stickerRef":"sr62b20_y96","_id":13179},{"id":1782277218554,"sender":"them","text":"呵，这下他们就算想听也听不到了。","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:42.862Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1779420032712","groupName":"午夜城强制休眠管控群","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":13181},{"id":1782277218555,"sender":"them","text":"所以……手掌再往里一点。圈圈，继续摸我。","timestamp":"2026-06-24T03:34:46.662Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1779420032712","groupName":"午夜城强制休眠管控群","userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c1